  "title": "Citrix NetScaler ADC/Gateway RCE and Web-Shell Activity",
  "description": "Citrix reported active exploitation of CVE-2026-88771 (critical unauthenticated RCE, CVSS 9.5) and CVE-2026-88772 against unmitigated NetScaler ADC and Gateway deployments. Related reporting describes command injection, memory overflow, PHP web shells, file exfiltration and tunneling via tools identified as WHIPSHOT and SLAPSHOT. This package provides web-service, web-shell and appliance-egress detection, hunting and response content.",
